[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]Empty stat command!
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]Here is the brief list of stats console commands
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat dumpframe [-ms=5.0] [-root=empty] [-depth=maxint] - dumps a frame of stats
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]	stat dumpframe -ms=.001 -root=initviews
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]	stat dumpframe -ms=.001 -root=shadow
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat dumpave|dumpmax|dumpsum  [-start | -stop | -num=30] [-ms=5.0] [-depth=maxint] - aggregate stats over multiple frames
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat dumphitches - toggles dumping hitches
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat dumpevents [-ms=0.2] [-all] - dumps events history for slow events, -all adds other threads besides game and render
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat dumpnonframe - dumps non-frame stats, usually memory stats
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat dumpcpu - dumps cpu stats
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat groupname[+] - toggles displaying stats group, + enables hierarchical display
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat hier -group=groupname [-sortby=name] [-maxhistoryframes=60] [-reset] [-maxdepth=4]
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]	- groupname is a stat group like initviews or statsystem
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]	- sortby can be name (by stat FName), callcount (by number of calls, only for scoped cycle counters), num(by total inclusive time)
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]	- maxhistoryframes (default 60, number of frames used to generate the stats displayed on the hud)
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]	- reset (reset the accumulated history)
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]	- maxdepth (default 4, maximum depth for the hierarchy)
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat none - disables drawing all stats groups
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat group list|listall|enable name|disable name|none|all|default - manages stats groups
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat display -font=small[tiny]
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]	Changes stats rendering display options
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat startfile - starts dumping a capture
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat stopfile - stops dumping a capture (regular, raw, memory)
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat startfileraw - starts dumping a raw capture
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat toggledebug - toggles tracking the most memory expensive stats
[2025.11.02-06.13.19:176][985]stat slow [-ms=1.0] [-depth=4] - toggles displaying the game and render thread stats
